# circleci_ios_signing_certificate (Resource)

Uploads an Apple code-signing certificate (a `.p12` file and its password) to a CircleCI organization, for signing iOS builds. Pair it with one or more provisioning profiles using [`circleci_ios_signing_config`](./ios_signing_config).

## Availability

| CircleCI Cloud | CircleCI Server |
|---|---|
| yes | **no** |

~> **Not available on CircleCI Server.** Signing certificates are served by the CircleCI v3 API, which CircleCI Server does not route to the public API service. The certificate itself is only useful to a **macOS executor** building and signing an iOS app.

